    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "XmlPullParserException, which is used by trippi which is used in the risearch interface in the fedora client recide in xpp3_min as shown by this stacktrace",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Caused by: java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: org/xmlpull/v1/XmlPullParserException",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.trippi.TupleIterator.fromStream(TupleIterator.java:152)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.client.FedoraClient.getTuples(FedoraClient.java:681)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at net.sourceforge.ecm.repository.FedoraSoapImpl.query(FedoraSoapImpl.java:337)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Thus you cannot use the fedora client getTuples method until this jar is bundled.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
